I hate that kind of thing!

266
00:19:42,730 --> 00:19:44,820
Hey, that's enough. Stop it.

267
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:51,230
I'm sorry. Please forgive me...

268
00:19:51,230 --> 00:19:52,500
Damn!

269
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:57,210
Hey, kid.

270
00:19:58,410 --> 00:20:00,510
Sorry 'bout that.

271
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:04,080
Ah...no...

272
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:09,540
I'll make sure that Masaru pays you
back the entire 50,000 yen you paid.

273
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:14,080
I-I'm sorry!

274
00:20:15,430 --> 00:20:17,390
I'm...sorry...

275
00:20:19,430 --> 00:20:21,920
Damn, you're despicable!

276
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:27,830
"Higashi Middle School Festival"

277
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:51,060
What's with that trophy?

278
00:20:51,060 --> 00:20:53,790
It's the award for the Best Guitarist.

279
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:10,040
Well, I'll leave it here for you.

280
00:21:29,270 --> 00:21:33,000
This one's broken, so I'll take it.

281
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:37,440
Momoko-sensei said she'll be
getting the other one next week.

282
00:21:45,620 --> 00:21:51,620
Even though the results showed a tie,
I still think you're a better player.

283
00:21:51,620 --> 00:21:52,920
Of course!

284
00:21:58,630 --> 00:22:01,460
I got some bandages for you.

285
00:22:01,460 --> 00:22:06,140
But you managed to get
this good in just one year.

286
00:22:06,140 --> 00:22:10,330
In my opinion, you're the
first worthy rival I've met.

287
00:22:19,650 --> 00:22:22,580
Pretty dismal isn't it, that trophy?

288
00:22:50,410 --> 00:22:52,510
Another minute

289
00:22:52,510 --> 00:22:55,200
Feelin' so fine

290
00:22:57,510 --> 00:22:59,750
You turn the freeze

291
00:22:59,750 --> 00:23:02,480
into warm light

292
00:23:04,590 --> 00:23:08,060
Had a premonition

293
00:23:08,060 --> 00:23:10,730
I've been waitin' ever since

294
00:23:10,730 --> 00:23:14,230
My world comin' down

295
00:23:14,230 --> 00:23:17,030
It's got me spinnin' 'round

296
00:23:18,800 --> 00:23:24,970
If you really wanna fly

297
00:23:24,970 --> 00:23:27,740
you gotta let go

298
00:23:39,990 --> 00:23:42,320
Simply the most

299
00:23:42,320 --> 00:23:44,360
big sensation

300
00:23:44,360 --> 00:23:47,160
(once you're here you won't go back)

301
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:49,430
She's really pretty

302
00:23:49,430 --> 00:23:51,430
One-eyed vision

303
00:23:51,430 --> 00:23:54,270
(lose the fear it don't come back)

304
00:23:54,270 --> 00:23:57,770
Little sister showed me

305
00:23:57,770 --> 00:24:00,440
Really took me for a ride

306
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:02,110
My world comin' down

307
00:24:02,110 --> 00:24:05,450
(once you're here you won't go back)

308
00:24:05,450 --> 00:24:09,470
(lose the fear it don't come back)

309
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:18,260
Wow, the way the sound of the horns
reverberates throughout...

310
00:24:18,260 --> 00:24:20,190
Gotta love it-Chinatown.
